  - software: scipy
  - parameter: kappa in {3,4,5}, sigma in {0.1,0.5}, n_T in {0,1,2,3} [3 Light Curve Analysis: "$\kappa \in \{3,4,5\}$, $\sigma \in \{0.1,0.5\}$, and $n_T \in \{0,1,2,3\}$"]
  - validation: Splines visually characterize Q and U without obvious over-fitting [3 Light Curve Analysis: "We find that these splines are generally able to characterize the $Q$ and $U$ behavior well, without obvious over-fitting."]
