- result: sigma_V = <~30 ± upper limit km/s [Table 1: "$\sigma_{\rm V}$ ($\mathrm{km}\,\mathrm{s}^{-1}$) | $\lesssim$30"]
- result: inclination = 50 ± 4 deg [Table 1: "$i$ ($^{\circ}$) | $50\pm4$"]
